\sum_{k=1}^{8}\binom{16-k}{k-1}
= \binom{15}{0}+\binom{14}{1}+\binom{13}{2}+\binom{12}{3}+\binom{11}{4}+\binom{10}{5}+\binom{9}{6}+\binom{8}{7}
\]

\[
=1+14+78+220+330+252+84+8=987.
\]

